{"title":"Bandit Footpad","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Bandit Footpad is a named <a href=\"#/monster/footpad\">Footpad</a> seen at level 6–8 (archer).</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Bandit Footpad</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia%20Iron%20Mine\">Binxonia Iron Mine</a></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"bandit-footpad\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">10 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bandit-tunic\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d7826cf6366831b7b094.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit Tunic</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"fine-trousers\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e55acc011886a033e0b5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fine Trousers</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"deerhide-legs\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3c471d02a376b5a951dd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deerhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+6 more\">+6 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-small\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/4b59eb